  "title": "Campfire Potatoes and Carrots",
  "description": "This recipe is a fast, easy, and delicious way to roast potatoes and carrots on the campfire in a foil packet, seasoned with butter and onion soup mix.",
  "authors": [
    "Kristin"
  ],
